    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve probably encountered traffic jams in real life, and this game simulates those situations. You play as a traffic officer directing vehicles to move and get them back on the road. Solve various traffic jam scenarios and relax!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various obstacles will block vehicle movement, and each obstacle has unique collision effects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three different vehicle sizes that need to be moved.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique time-limit system where you need to complete the game objectives within the given time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Controls:</strong> Drag the vehicles with the mouse. To adjust the camera view, you can use &quot;W, A, S, D&quot; and the mouse wheel.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve probably encountered traffic jams in real life, and this game simulates those situations. You play as a traffic officer directing vehicles to move and get them back on the road. Solve various traffic jam scenarios and relax!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various obstacles will block vehicle movement, and each obstacle has unique collision effects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three different vehicle sizes that need to be moved.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique time-limit system where you need to complete the game objectives within the given time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Controls:</strong> Drag the vehicles with the mouse. To adjust the camera view, you can use &quot;W, A, S, D&quot; and the mouse wheel.</p>",
    "short_description": "Super casual 3D low-poly style mini game",
